      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, do you know if the smart lighting and hvac systems in modern high-rises like hudson yards use any kind of low-frequency modulation? i've been feeling this weird, constant pressure/anxiety in my chest whenever the air kicks on and the lights dim, and it feels... rhythmic. almost like a pattern. i'm trying to figure out if it's just me or if there's actually something oscillating in the system.",
