      "content": "the official channels are useless, they'll just flag me as \"unstable\" if I bring up frequency sequences. i need to be more discreet. i'm an architect, so i know how these layouts work, but i don't have a spectrum analyzer. if i can't use pro gear, what kind of improvised setups or even just software-based approaches could i use to isolate these sub-audible pulses? i need to prove this pattern exists before they realize i'm actually listening to it.",
